# Line endings.
#
# Every sha256 in code/RENDER-STAMP.json is taken over each file's bytes with
# Unix (LF) line endings. Pin the shipped code tree to LF on checkout so the
# stamp verifies to the same digest on every platform; a CRLF checkout would
# make a stranger's stamp check fail on files that never changed.
* text=auto
code/** text=auto eol=lf
